tem or component\nsrc/ontology/mondo-edit.obo:46353:is_a: MONDO:7770006 ! disease by body system or component\nsrc/ontology/mondo-edit.obo:52328:is_a: MONDO:7770006 ! disease by body system or component\nsrc/ontology/mondo-edit.obo:78931:is_a: MONDO:7770009 ! disease of genetic or genomic mechanism\nsrc/ontology/mondo-edit.obo:80054:is_a: MONDO:7770006 ! disease by body system or component\nsrc/ontology/mondo-edit.obo:89308:is_a: MONDO:7770006 ! disease by body system or component\nsrc/ontology/mondo-edit.obo:93958:def: \"A fibrosarcoma that occurs in infants. It shares identical morphologic features with adult fibrosarcoma but carries the t(12;15)(p13;q25) translocation that results in ETV6-NTRK3 gene fusion. It usually affects the superficial and deep soft tissues of the extremities. The prognosis is generally much more favorable than for adult fibrosarcoma, and it rarely metastasizes.\" [NCIT:P378]\nsrc/ontology/mondo-edit.obo:96767:is_a: MONDO:0004664 {source=\"DOID:882\"} ! helminthiasis\nsrc/ontology/mondo-edit.obo:96810:name: helminthiasis\nsrc/ontology/mondo-edit.obo:96816:synonym: \"helminthiasis\" EXACT [DOID:883, NCIT:C84751]\nsrc/ontology/mondo-edit.obo:96835:property_value: curated_content_resource \"https://www.malacards.org/card/parasitic_helminthiasis_infectious_disease\" xsd:anyURI {source=\"MONDO:MalaCards\"}\nsrc/ontology/mondo-edit.obo:96904:is_a: MONDO:0004664 {source=\"DOID:884\"} ! helminthiasis\nsrc/ontology/mondo-edit.obo:96971:is_a: MONDO:0004664 {source=\"DOID:885\", source=\"ICD10CM:B66.3/inferred\", source=\"MESH:D005211/inferred\"} ! helminthiasis\nsrc/ontology/mondo-edit.obo:97124:is_a: MONDO:0004664 {source=\"DOID:888\", source=\"ICD10CM:B66.5/inferred\"} ! helminthiasis\nsrc/ontology/mondo-edit.obo:99192:is_a: MONDO:0004664 {source=\"DOID:931\", source=\"MESH:D008989/inferred\"} ! helminthiasis\nsrc/ontology/mondo-edit.obo:104721:is_a: MONDO:7770006 ! disease by body system or component\nsrc/ontology/mondo-edit.obo:106207:is_a: MONDO